   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Repeated actions",
     "texto": [
      "**Berkali-kali**, **berteriak-teriak** and **memanggil-manggil** express repetition. The base can be repeated on its own or together with an affix.",
      "Do not automatically translate every reduplication as a plural: its function depends on the form and the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sets and variety",
     "texto": [
      "**Dedaunan** and **pepohonan** can refer to many elements of the set. **Sayur-mayur** and **lauk-pauk** name varieties; the change of sound is part of those expressions."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
